? The book titled Norwegian Wood features Ruben Knutsen who builds a tidy stack of wood every year. The author of this question learned what then happens to the stack and compared it to THIS. Identify THIS, using a word in which all vowels are the same.
! mandala.
/ The stacks that Knutsen builds are circular and resemble a mandala, the Buddhist symbol of the universe. For one specific ritual, a mandala is painstakingly created using coloured sand and then destroyed, reflecting the fleeting nature of the universe. Knutsen does the same, he builds a stack and destroys it.
^ 
